/E ( Settlement Option:                                                                                                                                          Under this option, you will receive the maturity benefit in a structured payout over a period you choose \(not exceeding 5 years from maturity date\) with the first instalment being paid on the date of maturity. Risk cover \(excluding riders, if any\) will be available during this period. In case of death of life assured during this period, benefit paid will be higher of \(a\) Total fund value as on date of intimation of death, or \(b\) 105% of Premiums Paid and the policy will be terminated. During the settlement period, partial withdrawal is not allowed, however, Fund Switches is allowed. During the settlement period, fund management charges and mortality charges shall continue to be levied.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
